# Control is not ownership. Bot1 owns Lumbering Worldwagon and has two lands (the Forest and the one the Worldwagon found); on turn 2 Bot2's Dack Fayden takes it (-2: gain control of target artifact) and
# Bot2 crews it with a Cathar Commando and a Containment Priest (power 3 + 2, Crew 4). "Power equal to the number of lands you control" now counts Bot2's lands: its one Plains, so 1 - not Bot1's two.

